Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Bridge delivery: package mode=bridge, enum, refund hooks

Package::dispatchCommands sends bridge groups through MinecraftOperationDispatcher.
Adds group_grant/group_revoke/kit_credit enum cases, admin routes, successor
PendingActivation, package form include, check command registration.

